stages.sampleAnswer:
Admin API:
POST /seeds  body: { urls: [...], priority }  → enqueues into frontier
GET /status → { pagesPerSec, queueDepth, errorRate }
POST /hosts/:host/policy  body: { crawlDelayMs, maxConcurrency }

Internal: fetcher workers pull URLs from the frontier (Kafka topic partitioned by host), publish fetched-pages and discovered-links events to other topics.
